---
import:
  - stdlib/lang/go
  - stdlib/library/common
description: A library in Go 1.25, as one Go module.
---

***implementation reqs***

- :Implementation: is one Go module whose root package is its public API, documented in `doc.go`, with everything else in packages under `internal/`.
- :Implementation: declares its errors as sentinel values and error types in `errors.go`.
- :Implementation: logs only through a `*slog.Logger` the caller passes in, and nothing when none is given.
